  "scope": [
    "Normal stopped handoffs between the recorded pairs of distinct helper builds with the same manifest schema, engine, SDK revision, package policy, and platform asset digest.",
    "Every manifest asset was verified. The macOS helper code signatures were checked.",
    "Each run used a PostgreSQL-backed SmolBox consumer. The replacement had to open a different helper epoch. Exact identity, receipts, results, and reservations were checked independently of scheduler claim and due-time changes.",
    "OCI used generated credentials and a private loopback registry. The fixture used the SDK metadata-only egress floor for the test processes and an exact /32 guest allowlist."
  ],
  "existing_stopped_upgrade_evidence": {
    "linux_growth_both_toolchains": "docs/evidence/embedded-port-http-parity-queued-start-8887970d.json",
